<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>Real MRR only</strong>: the MRR counts what a paid invoice covers right now. An active subscription with nothing paid for its current period is out: one that never paid (a free period after the trial, a 100% coupon) is read as a trial until its first charge; a renewal not paid yet is at risk; a free month for a paying customer leaves the MRR for that month.</li>
</ul>
